Section: net
Maintainer: Brady Catherman <ubuntu@gecka.us>
Source: homehub
Priority: extra
Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Build-Depends: debhelper, golang-go (>= 2:1.16)
Homepage: https://github.com/Iterable/blobby
Vcs-Git: git://github.com/Iterable/blobby.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/Iterable/Blobby

Package: homehub
Architecture: amd64 armhf arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: A family coordination application for touchscreens.
  This desktop application for touchscreen-enabled Ubuntu machines allows a
  family to coordinate activities, manage shopping lists, track finances,
  display photos, and view weather, all accessible via a customizable
  icon-based navigation menu.

